# Azula's controller may cast a card exiled with Azula during their own turn and as though it had flash (CR 601.3b, 117.1a),
# but not on an opponent's turn. Ornithopter (a creature, so normally sorcery-speed) is cast from exile in Bot1's end step; on
# Bot2's turn Lightning Bolt - an instant, so only the "during your turn" limit stops it - is refused even with mana available.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Azula, Cunning Usurper
Swamp
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x17

